---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Knee Pain Physiotherapy in Faridabad | Neriva Health" 
    description="Specialized knee physiotherapy in Sector 45, Faridabad. Treatment for osteoarthritis, ACL injuries, and post-knee replacement rehabilitation."
>
    <section class="section-padding" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-blue);">Knee Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                Whether you're dealing with osteoarthritis, a sports injury like an ACL tear, or recovering from a knee replacement surgery, our targeted knee rehabilitation programs aim to restore your mobility and strength.
            </p>

            <div style="background: var(--bg-light); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Comprehensive Knee Care</h2>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li><strong>Osteoarthritis Management:</strong> Pain relief techniques and joint-preserving exercises.</li>
                    <li><strong>Ligament & Meniscus Rehab:</strong> Structured recovery plans for sports-related knee injuries.</li>
                    <li><strong>Post-Surgical Recovery:</strong> Safe and progressive therapy following TKR (Total Knee Replacement) or arthroscopy.</li>
                    <li><strong>Gait Training:</strong> Improving how you walk to reduce stress on the knee joint.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Start Moving Freely Again</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light);">Schedule a comprehensive knee assessment with Dr. Abhishek Kumar.</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/919650940281?text=Hi,%20I'm%20experiencing%20knee%20pain%20and%20would%20like%20to%20book%20a%20physiotherapy%20assessment." target="_blank" class="btn btn-accent" style="margin-right: 1rem;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
            <a href="tel:9650940281" class="btn btn-primary">Call Clinic</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
